  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_8379.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Las personas que han ido a comprar la ma&ntilde;&aacute;na de este s&aacute;bado al mercado municipal de Onda han podido degustar una gustosa variedad de tapas y un chato de vino por cada tiquet de compra en alguna de las paradas que presentaban, en la actividad Mercatapa 2013.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8374.jpg\" alt=\"img_8374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8375.jpg\" alt=\"img_8375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8376.jpg\" alt=\"img_8376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8377.jpg\" alt=\"img_8377\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8378.jpg\" alt=\"img_8378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8379.jpg\" alt=\"img_8379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8380.jpg\" alt=\"img_8380\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8381.jpg\" alt=\"img_8381\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8382.jpg\" alt=\"img_8382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatapa2013/img_8383.jpg\" alt=\"img_8383\" style=\"max-width